# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the Debug-ASan smoke test (LSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=<this file>).
# Only libraries outside the engine. miniaudio dlopens the audio backends it probes, and JACK's
# static initialisers leak (frames of an unloaded library print as <unknown module>, so the
# dlopen's caller is the name to match); Mesa's swap-chain creation and GLFW's X11 teardown leak
# through libxcb (LINUX-SUPPORT.md, "LeakSanitizer").
leak:ma_dlopen
leak:libxcb.so
leak:libX11.so
